# case: relative base
step 1: gomcplayer Steve 0 4 0
  count: 1
  feedback: Successfully created the player Steve
step 2: tp Steve 7.5 4 4.5
  count: 1
  feedback: Teleported Steve to 7.5, 4.0, 4.5
step 3: execute @a ~ ~ ~ setblock ~2.6 ~ ~ dirt
  count: 1
  feedback: Block placed
step 4: testforblock 9 4 4 dirt
  count: 1
  feedback: Successfully found the block at 9, 4, 4
step 5: testforblock 10 4 4 dirt
  error: The block at 10, 4, 4 is Air (expected: Dirt)
